@startuml sd-05-clear
' Owner: Rachit | SAD 4.2 | SD-05 Clear the board with interrupted-clear recovery
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 140
skinparam ParticipantPadding 2
skinparam BoxPadding 2
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F5F8FC
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #3B5B85
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
hide footbox
title SD-05 (part 1) — clear request, authorisation and before-clear version

participant "Owner\nclient\n(COMP-01/02)" as OC
participant "Real-time\nServer\n(COMP-06)" as RT
participant "Board &\nAccess\n(COMP-05)" as AC
participant "Version\nHistory\n(COMP-07)" as VER
participant "Persist-\nence\n(COMP-08)" as DB
participant "Other\nclients" as OTH

== Request (FR-007) ==
note over OC : Owner chooses "Clear board" and confirms
OC -> RT : op:submit {boardId, clientOpId:c5, type:"board:clear"}
RT -> RT : clear task enters the board queue\n(operations, restores and clears run one at a time)
RT -> AC : authorize(actor, boardId, "clear")
AC --> RT : allowed (Editor/Viewer: FORBIDDEN)
RT -> RT : board empty? -> ack {ok:true, seq:null, noop:true}; stop
RT -> VER : before-clear trigger (no-change rule)
VER -> DB : insert version v (trigger "before_clear")\nif the board changed since the last version
DB --> VER : ok (alt 2 if the write fails)
VER --> RT : pre-clear content preserved

newpage SD-05 (part 2) — commit, delete and complete

== [alt 1] journalled clear ==
RT -> DB : COMMIT: boards.pendingOp = {type:"clear",\n seq:61, preClearVersion:v}  [journaled]
RT -> DB : delete all boardObjects of the board
RT -> DB : COMPLETE: seq = 61, contentBytes = 0,\nunset pendingOp  [one atomic, journaled update]
RT --> OC : ack {ok:true, clientOpId:c5, seq:61}
RT -> OTH : op:applied {seq:61, type:"board:clear"}
note over OC, OTH : No acknowledgement or broadcast before COMPLETE.

== [alt 2] before-clear version cannot be written ==
RT --> OC : ack {ok:false, clientOpId:c5, error:{code:"INTERNAL"}}
note right of RT : Nothing deleted, nothing broadcast;\nop.clear_failed logged.

newpage SD-05 (part 3) — start-up recovery of an interrupted clear

== Crash after COMMIT; server start, before accepting connections ==
RT -> DB : find boards with pendingOp
DB --> RT : board b1: {type:"clear", seq:61, preClearVersion:v}
RT -> DB : delete remaining boardObjects of the board
RT -> DB : COMPLETE: seq = 61, contentBytes = 0, unset pendingOp
RT -> RT : log board.clear_rolled_forward;\nthen sequence recovery and size recomputation
note right of RT : If recovery fails (database error):\nrecovery.required logged; the server\nexits without accepting connections.
OC -> RT : reconnect; board:join
RT --> OC : ack {state:{seq:61, objects:[]}}
note right of OC : The Owner never received a success ack for c5;\nafter resynchronisation the client shows the empty\nboard and the "unconfirmed changes" notice (FR-025).
@enduml
